# Skills and commands are parsed by strict YAML-frontmatter parsers on claude.ai —
# CRLF line endings make a skill silently invisible there. Force LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
